```
<title>Welcome to PH Healthcare System</title>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f4f7f9;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .header {
    background-color: #0f766e;
    padding: 32px 30px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 25px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .header p {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .content {
    padding: 38px 30px;
  }

  .content h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 23px;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .message {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .welcome-box {
    margin: 30px 0;
    padding: 24px;
    background-color: #f0fdfa;
    border: 1px solid #ccfbf1;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .welcome-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
    background-color: #0f766e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 52px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .welcome-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #0f766e;
  }

  .welcome-text {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .features {
    margin: 30px 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .features h3 {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .feature {
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .feature span {
    color: #0f766e;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .security-box {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 15px;
    background-color: #f9fafb;
    border-left: 4px solid #0f766e;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .footer {
    padding: 22px 30px;
    background-color: #f9fafb;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .footer p {
    margin: 6px 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .container {
      margin: 15px;
    }

    .content,
    .header,
    .footer {
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .content h2 {
      font-size: 21px;
    }
  }
</style>
```

  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">

```
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header">
    <h1>PH Healthcare System</h1>
    <p>Your healthcare, connected.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="content">

    <h2>Welcome, <%= name %>! 👋</h2>

    <p class="message">
      We're delighted to have you with us.
      Your patient account has been successfully created and verified.
    </p>

    <!-- Welcome Box -->
    <div class="welcome-box">
      <div class="welcome-icon">✓</div>

      <p class="welcome-title">
        Your Account Is Ready
      </p>

      <p class="welcome-text">
        You can now securely access your account and start using
        PH Healthcare System to connect with healthcare professionals.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Features -->
    <div class="features">
      <h3>What you can do with your account</h3>

      <div class="feature">
        <span>✓</span>
        Find and explore available doctors
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <span>✓</span>
        Book available consultation slots
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <span>✓</span>
        Manage your appointments
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <span>✓</span>
        Attend online consultations
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <span>✓</span>
        Access your digital prescriptions
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Security Notice -->
    <div class="security-box">
      <strong>Security reminder:</strong>
      Please keep your account credentials private and never share
      your password or authentication information with anyone.
    </div>

    <p class="message" style="margin-top: 30px;">
      Thank you for choosing PH Healthcare System.
      We look forward to supporting your healthcare journey.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
      Warm regards,<br />
      <strong>PH Healthcare System Team</strong>
    </p>

  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    <p>
      This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.
    </p>

    <p>
      © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> PH Healthcare System.
      All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>
